Make event type names Qt-free.
eventtype.{h,cpp} is the only file in the subset whose *interface* is QString.
Ported to std::string, with QStringLiteral("%1 (%2)").arg() replaced by plain
concatenation and gettextFromC::tr() by the identity translate() from gettext.h.

